/-!
# Hecke L-functions

Umbrella for the programme on Hecke L-functions of a number field `K`: moduli `𝔪 = 𝔪₀ 𝔪∞`, the
reduction of elements prime to `𝔪` to `(𝓞_K/𝔪₀)ˣ × {±1}^{𝔪∞}`, the ray group `K^{𝔪,1}_+`, and the
finite ray class group `Cl_𝔪 = I^𝔪 / P_𝔪`.
-/
